OL,3,ATrump to speak to Putin about plague
OL,4,Alab worker's death in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump says he has a
OL,7,Fcall set up with Vladimir Putin about
OL,8,Fthe death of a lab worker at a plague
OL,9,Fresearch centre in Siberia.
OL,11,FRussian officials say they are
OL,12,Finvestigating the death of the
OL,13,F28-year-old employee and have not
OL,14,Fconfirmed that the suspected disease is
OL,15,Fpneumonic plague. They insist there is
OL,16,Fno risk of an epidemic.
OL,18,FTrump told reporters on Wednesday
OL,19,Fevening he did not believe it was a
OL,20,Fbioweapon, adding "we're going to find
OL,21,Fout soon enough, but we don't think
OL,22,Fso."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
